olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As Tottenham <a href=3D"https://ablink.edi=
torial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHE=
BgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPg-mtLC_F0Tid0ccf6_BkDKzeiyF8h8En-njY_s2MoRPx-lMYQu3NLD=
ot2IzrU30Gx06nRYZNJgD9LLvGfT3Say5PvZRbwAsl4X475QSNnsdcu3uOGTLF7sP88gzfYn09U=
gtARKxLMi2C308YN0GRU09djxaTLELJNPFyx89VDk3MEfRTVN-ee20RyXzwX88NNwUuMBOXQE2z=
9TUubNrPkb2UtymhHZWGW_MlcCNi5b1A/4v1/_3wi_aipTQCtcbeOS8EGeQ/h28/h001.Eyq9PQ=
ZxM7gqyS6fWFz6gnRsiu62FGA0YgwYnwA_X2k" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">edged to v=
ictory over Coventry</a>, a familiar face among the post-match salutations.=
 Could that be Dejan Kulusevski? For it was he, playing 526 days since his =
last Spurs appearance. Much has changed though still much stays the same. B=
en Davies=E2=80=99s deflected late clincher catapulted Spurs up to =E2=80=
=A6 16th. When Kulusevski last played on 11 May 2025, Tottenham were 17th, =
the position in which they finished both that season and in 2025-26.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">So what has changed? Ange Postecoglou was =
tinned that summer despite <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.=
com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHECoBtcQjat6FvTX4oDJN=
DqNnEgeFecSvQL4BlRubMtqQWoA2jqh9WtW4bV99RuzntuxDVa6-j4WvpFj0QMKH7FtTcUx37Kf=
eQNVRgmssZQSywfVjWhhzGPjmXNCQud9qPXvIKklZhkhgVOTF0u-cIYL2bs0xC8nB8i-gRUKsEb=
4JWNU2qO1SPqK4IU5UnKVraNVFYdu9QTJq-2tfe2dHD5wdvGSQjH36tgCpT1Rqq45FLWGi7kuTF=
bYa-b5oPE4MPoowuMtKg3SIAcm7nj5ikCt/4v1/_3wi_aipTQCtcbeOS8EGeQ/h29/h001.ZC6X=
6yIYrzZjxdgM_X3CCNA8N8daO5Q3Mpfxmh09bzo" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">winning =
the Flamin=E2=80=99 Bigger Vase</a>. Thomas Frank was an appointment the so=
ccer sensibles agreed was smart. A coach with impeccable credentials in imp=
roving players, willing to work in tandem with club suits, an ideal apex fo=
r an org chart. With lovely hair, too. <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.=
theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYS=
JYcaNsDra0BxnPgGC5yiBJuaqzT6i8HmG2A0aNhbY89ny8jum-6uU28vN3D6beSEWND1GIyCPxn=
4PKMl5fDqhMQdYd0cDBBRi6iN6J6XJjxXwJhnQYTTbFth-_0JDunuP-wMebSd4MY_KY1EUau-YA=
p1KfCGV0XWWyDOf0mxfRVw7gp7XUI6I-xceM_MywKR54ZC_xZpbgIUvnNKQTxn3jhDVA2NkCZYw=
4-Z33JehQfeoLWkeAxINlo_C0/4v1/_3wi_aipTQCtcbeOS8EGeQ/h30/h001.uESXKwxk06zGD=
ZmUANRPWWsGWM267WDfoMMpnXn_Yzs" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Frank was sent pa=
cking</a> in February, his popularity ratings plunging to depths unseen sin=
ce Alan Sugar had the bright idea of appointing George Graham, who had paid=
 his gardener to shape his lawn into the Arsenal crest. In football=E2=80=
=99s world of irrelevant but interesting (you sure? =E2=80=93 Football Dail=
y Ed) coincidences, the last time Spurs beat Coventry in the league, when S=
ergiy Rebrov=E2=80=99s goal <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian=
.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBtRyuiCQTQ2Qns7-r0=
TFFaZylWPTtO5OwztAVm0hcJJlihnv4M6E1Bqx_04JFGnqlf2r3R5drQD0ukoEluwsbY9RyxiQK=
aKevZR_VRZI2asX2snXtkyZSaTYqIFo_t2v51ZTHn3H48LXX6-LHI1NBp-BPHmdtSwwS48bbjqW=
tkYiOwfHVPtCIYo_nMhjT9gi_cWulv94_RQtDIjCWnoA20/4v1/_3wi_aipTQCtcbeOS8EGeQ/h=
31/h001.5iDI3D17s_08aRX0hrcKR0DqlGapayF2AnWgtrOSY4o" style=3D"color: #0077B=
6;">completed a 3-0 stroll in 2001</a>, the manager=E2=80=99s programme not=
es had been written by Gorgeous George, who the day previously had been the=
 recipient of Sugar=E2=80=99s =E2=80=9Cyou=E2=80=99re fired=E2=80=9D flex.<=
/p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Igor Tudor=E2=80=99s tenure resembled a sl=
asher movie, an appointment on the nod from a sporting director, Fabio Para=
tici, who had already left. Classic Spurs. What could possibly go wrong? Ev=
erything, it turns out. Or close to, until Roberto De Zerbi was handed the =
keys and a control none of his predecessors commanded. The transfer spend h=
as been heavy, and when Kulusevski arrived in the 87th minute on Monday, th=
e game not yet won, he did so following an absence where Spurs signed 20 pl=
ayers either permanently or on loan, at a cost of =C2=A3530m.<br><br>Scorin=
g Spurs=E2=80=99 opening goal on Monday was James Maddison. Football=E2=80=
=99s king of the oche was absent for almost as long Kulusevski. Last season=
, as De Zerbi attempted to arrest the slide towards relegation, =E2=80=98Ma=
dders=E2=80=99 initially sat on the bench on a vibes-only basis and closed =
out the season with not much more than 30 minutes of play, and had little t=
ime to do Maddison things like his arcing beauty against his hometown club =
on Monday, which opened the scoring for Spurs.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Good feelings at last, following a sunshin=
e break in Marbella where, according to De Zerbi, his players became less a=
 squad than a family. =E2=80=9CYou have to play for your friend and your br=
other, not like 11 robot players on the pitch,=E2=80=9D <a href=3D"https://=
ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEM=
gszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgVPLF0EXJpk2iWmUZU8jRVzUxsiUNRfTmq2lP_rk8zqN=
zI5LnYRpVWFiOQxNBUqb9g-ofdZv3he_zCrg7w6zBeY0xyvXR1rCk9-E1sRDrSgScsdRMxCvMfX=
NLU7uYAQYVhyPXb1nbl018CVSpHCqNUQDFvGZxGTU0DfM8hrOvngiWT6M5EcxkvBo5mMMROK0ho=
aSjok0OvNBD_UjHrlLR6A_Bvh0F63oxcYeVnK7k3eIYcSeT56V47DJYVXEZdan_/4v1/_3wi_ai=
pTQCtcbeOS8EGeQ/h32/h001.VAQKGx-6HuiVS3PdRHW3aYK3Aola7F9supRY63x5w8A" style=
=3D"color: #0077B6;">he cooed</a>. With two of his stars back in tandem, De=
 Zerbi=E2=80=99s enforcer intensity brought a first league win of the seaso=
n, to help Tottenham off the bottom. =E2=80=9CWith them in the dressing roo=
m there is another atmosphere,=E2=80=9D De Zerbi roared. Jam tomorrow? Glor=
y, glory? Lads, it=E2=80=99s etc =E2=80=A6</p>
